1
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,220
[Mount Zhaowu]

2
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,780
[Equal to Heaven and Earth]

3
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,840
Madam Wei, since you took over Mount Leiguan,

4
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:19,940
we of Mount Zhaowu

5
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:21,850
have yet to visit and pay our respects.

6
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,170
Please forgive

7
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:24,900
our lapse in courtesy.

8
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:29,220
[Wei Zhixi, New Leader of Mount Leiguan]

9
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,810
My master is unwell

10
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,450
and must meditate to recover.

11
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,940
He's therefore unable to attend,

12
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:34,940
so I'll be acting

13
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,410
as your host in his place today.

14
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,330
Spare us the pleasantries.

15
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:40,980
Is the news your master sent

16
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,130
with the Immortal Beacon true?

17
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:43,300
Was Qi Fengyin

18
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,650
really killed by Danshen's young disciple

19
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:46,540
with a single sword thrust?

20
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,300
There's no doubt.

21
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:49,690
Yamao

22
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:50,860
killed the devil herself

23
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:52,580
in front of my master

24
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:53,980
and all our fellow disciples.

25
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,450
Everyone at Mount Zhaowu

26
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:56,900
can bear witness.

27
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,000
Wonderful!

28
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,300
That herb spirit has so little power.

29
00:01:00,710 --> 00:01:01,820
How could she kill that devil?

30
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,930
Qi Fengyin hadn't recovered from his injuries.

31
00:01:05,350 --> 00:01:06,540
He thought he had Yamao

32
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,980
at his mercy,

33
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,980
so he let his guard down.

34
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,820
That gave her an opening.

35
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:13,460
He had only

36
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,260
his own arrogance to blame.

37
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,570
We've been on guard day and night.

38
00:01:17,790 --> 00:01:18,540
Who would've thought

39
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:19,690
Qi Fengyin

40
00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:20,930
would meet his end just like that?

41
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:21,410
Indeed.

42
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,620
Such an extraordinary feat has actually been achieved

43
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,100
before the Saintess of the Tides has even awakened.

44
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:26,900
This

45
00:01:26,950 --> 00:01:29,260
is a blessing for all beings in the Six Realms.

46
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,050
The world is rid of the devil

47
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,410
and restored to peace,

48
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:35,380
all thanks to Yamao.

49
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:36,820
Without her,

50
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,410
no one could have taken him

51
00:01:38,430 --> 00:01:39,260
by surprise.

52
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,020
In return,

53
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,740
she has a great favor

54
00:01:44,350 --> 00:01:45,740
to ask of you, our esteemed sect leaders.

55
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:59,050
Please, esteemed sect leaders, save my master.

56
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:27,940
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

57
00:02:29,980 --> 00:02:35,940
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

58
00:02:36,980 --> 00:02:41,220
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

59
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:52,460
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

60
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:59,580
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

61
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:07,460
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

62
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:15,500
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

63
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:23,620
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

64
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:30,180
[Blossom in Darkness]

65
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:32,180
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

66
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:35,180
[Episode 11]

67
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,820
We have many guests staying here today.

68
00:03:37,310 --> 00:03:39,010
Please take extra care with the arrangements.

69
00:03:39,590 --> 00:03:40,410
Yes, Qingxing.

70
00:03:42,910 --> 00:03:43,850
So we're treating her

71
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,730
as a guest of honor now?

72
00:03:48,590 --> 00:03:50,380
You mean Yamao?

73
00:03:51,590 --> 00:03:53,060
She rid the world of a menace.

74
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,290
That's no small achievement.

75
00:03:54,690 --> 00:03:55,510
Of course

76
00:03:55,590 --> 00:03:56,640
she deserves every courtesy.

77
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:57,870
How long is she staying?

78
00:03:58,710 --> 00:03:59,260
I'm not sure.

79
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,340
But

80
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:02,410
she's never liked Mount Zhaowu.

81
00:04:02,630 --> 00:04:03,570
I doubt she'll stay long.

82
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,820
Once High Immortal Danshen is saved,

83
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,890
she'll probably go back

84
00:04:06,910 --> 00:04:07,780
to Luoshen Valley with him.

85
00:04:08,150 --> 00:04:08,890
That's for the best.

86
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,890
We don't need her

87
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,610
causing more trouble here.

88
00:04:15,590 --> 00:04:16,980
You two really don't get along.

89
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,430
Do you have a grudge against her?

90
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,610
Why would I hold a grudge?

91
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,170
When she was mixed up

92
00:04:23,190 --> 00:04:24,100
with that devil,

93
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,610
of course I was hostile toward her.

94
00:04:26,390 --> 00:04:28,340
Now that she's cut ties with him,

95
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,610
why would I have a problem with her?

96
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,020
Still,

97
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,610
she stayed by Qi Fengyin's side,

98
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:37,540
biding her time for so long.

99
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:39,810
She must be quite the schemer.

100
00:04:40,190 --> 00:04:40,930
You'd better

101
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,850
keep your distance from her too.

102
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,370
That wretched Yamao.

103
00:04:57,830 --> 00:04:58,730
She kept telling

104
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:00,020
His Lordship to trust her,

105
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:02,170
but she had it all planned from the start.

106
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,290
I'll avenge His Lordship.

107
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,050
Esteemed sect leaders,

108
00:05:08,430 --> 00:05:09,050
my master

109
00:05:09,310 --> 00:05:10,980
exhausted all his spiritual power

110
00:05:12,070 --> 00:05:12,850
defending the Saintess's Shrine

111
00:05:13,310 --> 00:05:14,370
during the firestorm

112
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,460
and turned into this soul crystal.

113
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,700
Now that Qi Fengyin is dead,

114
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:20,460
for the sake of your bonds

115
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,050
with my master,

116
00:05:22,390 --> 00:05:23,340
please save him.

117
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,340
We can't afford any more delay.

118
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,980
While trying to revive the Saintess of the Tides,

119
00:05:29,430 --> 00:05:30,730
we had our differences with you

120
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,490
and neglected High Immortal Danshen.

121
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,660
It was our fault.

122
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:37,250
High Immortal Danshen is a man of integrity.

123
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:39,780
He's given his all for the immortal sects.

124
00:05:40,630 --> 00:05:42,700
We'll do everything we can.

125
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,250
But now,

126
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:46,290
with only his spirit left in this world,

127
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:48,580
how can we help you?

128
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,460
My master said

129
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,290
that Master Cang had a magical artifact

130
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:56,490
brimming with spiritual power.

131
00:05:57,430 --> 00:05:58,050
Perhaps

132
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,580
it could bring High Immortal Danshen back.

133
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:07,730
What's with that look?

134
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,850
Our sects stand together to fight evil and uphold justice.

135
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:11,410
High Immortal Danshen and Mount Zhaowu

136
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,220
have done

137
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,020
all the work for us.

138
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:15,140
Now you're even reluctant

139
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:16,340
to lend out an artifact?

140
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,490
I'm not reluctant.

141
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,930
It's only an artifact.

142
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,220
Do you think I can't spare it?

143
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:29,050
This is Luoliang Immortal Sect's

144
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:29,990
most powerful

145
00:06:29,990 --> 00:06:30,730
artifact:

146
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:32,930
the Demon Soul Talisman.

147
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:56,340
That talisman is mine.

148
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,140
Since we have the artifact,

149
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:04,370
let's not waste any time.

150
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,250
Master Cang, please tell us

151
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,610
how we can save High Immortal Danshen.

152
00:07:10,870 --> 00:07:11,410
It can't save him.

153
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:13,900
Why not?

154
00:07:15,310 --> 00:07:16,140
If it could,

155
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,370
I'd have brought it out long ago.

156
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:20,290
Can't you see?

157
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:22,700
This artifact

158
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,170
was damaged in an incident.

159
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,540
A corner's missing.

160
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:26,580
It no longer has

161
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,610
any spiritual power.

162
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:28,930
Oh, no.

163
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,290
If it's no longer useful,

164
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,540
then Master...

165
00:07:33,510 --> 00:07:34,220
My master

166
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,370
already knew about the Demon Soul Talisman

167
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,610
and that it was damaged.

168
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:40,580
He's taught me a way to repair it.

169
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:42,460
If you all combine

170
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,850
your spiritual power to reforge it,

171
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,540
it can be fully restored.

172
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,780
You have a way to repair it?

173
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,340
Why didn't you say so sooner?

174
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,700
If you'd known sooner,

175
00:07:53,830 --> 00:07:55,140
you'd have settled in here

176
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:56,050
and refused to leave.

177
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,220
The technique my master taught me

178
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,020
takes seven days.

179
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:01,540
During that time,

180
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,250
I ask that you all

181
00:08:03,430 --> 00:08:04,780
remain here at Mount Zhaowu.

182
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,250
I've already had

183
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,100
guest rooms prepared for you.

184
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,930
Let go of me!

185
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:28,610
That thing belongs to me!

186
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,250
Are you going to repay my kindness

187
00:08:32,250 --> 00:08:33,010
by killing me?

188
00:08:33,910 --> 00:08:35,420
I never should've used my herbs to save you.

189
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:36,820
You've got it wrong.

190
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,980
I'm not trying to kill you.

191
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,460
I'm a demon.

192
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:40,820
You sect lackeys and I

193
00:08:40,870 --> 00:08:41,610
are sworn enemies.

194
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,730
Don't expect me

195
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,580
to believe you!

196
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,180
All the sect leaders are here today.

197
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,000
It's far too dangerous

198
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,940
for you to hide there.

199
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,300
Any one of them

200
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,180
could reduce you to ashes

201
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:52,250
with a wave of their hand.

202
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,010
That's why I got you out of there.

203
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:58,340
Thank you for saving me

204
00:08:58,670 --> 00:09:00,220
from the miasma of desire in Peach Blossom Paradise.

205
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:02,890
I've been meaning to thank you in person ever since.

206
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,180
Looks like you have a conscience.

207
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:21,460
Those were

208
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,840
my lifesaving herbs.

209
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,220
They're priceless.

210
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,980
You owe me a debt of gratitude.

211
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:28,770
Don't you ever forget it.

212
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,820
Offer me three incense sticks

213
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,580
morning and night.

214
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,530
If I get the chance,

215
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:35,610
I promise

216
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,130
I'll repay you properly.

217
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:38,490
But today,

218
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,770
all the sects are gathered at Mount Zhaowu.

219
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,730
If a little demon like you

220
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:42,730
is discovered hiding here,

221
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:43,940
you won't survive.

222
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,680
So

223
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,570
I must ask you

224
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,850
to leave Mount Zhaowu at once.

225
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:49,530
I'm no little demon!

226
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,180
I'm a mighty demon!

227
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:56,580
Don't look down on me.

228
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:58,490
I'll go wherever I please

229
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,420
on your wretched mountain!

230
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:11,490
Hao.

231
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,700
Thank you for your help today.

232
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,980
Even if you hadn't asked,

233
00:10:17,150 --> 00:10:17,610
we'd still do

234
00:10:17,870 --> 00:10:19,180
all we could to save High Immortal Danshen.

235
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:22,580
Everything that happened

236
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:24,650
happened because of Qi Fengyin.

237
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,220
I hope you won't hold it against us.

238
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,250
I know it wasn't personal.

239
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,460
As long as Master can be saved,

240
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:34,250
a few setbacks don't matter.

241
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,250
At least it's all settled now.

242
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,100
But...

243
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,180
something still baffles me.

244
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,490
After that long talk we had,

245
00:10:47,030 --> 00:10:47,850
I thought

246
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,940
you considered Qi Fengyin a friend.

247
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,890
Why did you turn on him?

248
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,820
Qi Fengyin used my master's life to blackmail me.

249
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,980
I've wanted to kill him more than once.

250
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:02,420
Back at Mount Leiguan,

251
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:04,300
if he hadn't been lucky enough to escape,

252
00:11:05,030 --> 00:11:06,130
he never would've lived this long.

253
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,130
Besides,

254
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,250
isn't Qi Fengyin's death

255
00:11:10,750 --> 00:11:11,820
something to celebrate?

256
00:11:14,030 --> 00:11:15,820
Why do you sound almost sorry

257
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:17,250
that he's dead, Hao?

258
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,490
Do you think

259
00:11:18,630 --> 00:11:19,680
he didn't deserve to die?

260
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:20,460
Of course not.

261
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,340
Qi Fengyin is the source of all evil.

262
00:11:22,790 --> 00:11:23,730
Had he become the Devil Incarnate,

263
00:11:23,910 --> 00:11:24,850
he would've wreaked havoc on the world.

264
00:11:25,790 --> 00:11:26,730
You once thought

265
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:28,130
someone else might have caused

266
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:28,940
the firestorm in Luoshen Valley.

267
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,060
I asked Master when I returned.

268
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:33,890
He said only the Saintess of the Tides,

269
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:35,580
if she were still alive,

270
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,130
could match him in power.

271
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:39,890
So

272
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,100
the firestorm in Luoshen Valley

273
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:43,980
could only have been Qi Fengyin's doing?

274
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:45,060
That's right.

275
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:46,650
So by killing him,

276
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:47,770
you've done

277
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,700
both your master and the world a tremendous service.

278
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,980
Where has Uncle Du

279
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:55,770
taken Duyao?

280
00:11:56,510 --> 00:11:57,370
Is she really

281
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,940
one of his artifacts in human form?

282
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,100
I've never seen Master use

283
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,010
an artifact like that.

284
00:12:03,390 --> 00:12:04,060
But don't worry.

285
00:12:04,790 --> 00:12:06,460
He'd never harm an innocent person.

286
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:08,340
She's safe at Mount Zhaowu.

287
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:09,890
Just

288
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,460
stay here and get some rest

289
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:12,940
until High Immortal Danshen returns.

290
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:15,490
Thank you, Hao.

291
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:18,010
Oh, Hao,

292
00:12:18,670 --> 00:12:19,650
at the Zi hour tonight,

293
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:20,730
come to the hill out back.

294
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:25,890
Make sure you come.

295
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:13,460
You're awake.

296
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:17,910
Don't be afraid.

297
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:19,850
I mean you no harm.

298
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,890
You've been asleep for so long.

299
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,940
It seems you haven't fully adjusted

300
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,700
to this world yet.

301
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:28,580
Am I really one of your artifacts in human form?

302
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:30,820
Of course not.

303
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,420
But I'm the only one in this world

304
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:38,370
who knows who you really are.

305
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:39,610
Who am I, really?

306
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:41,700
And why did I

307
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,770
find Qi Fengyin so familiar?

308
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,060
In a few days,

309
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:46,530
I'll need your help

310
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,300
with something very important.

311
00:13:49,150 --> 00:13:49,820
If you agree to help,

312
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:53,060
I'll tell you who you really are

313
00:13:53,750 --> 00:13:54,980
when the time comes.

314
00:13:56,670 --> 00:13:57,850
What do I need to do?

315
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,100
When the time is right,

316
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:01,650
I'll tell you.

317
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:11,850
Let this golden seal bind our pact.

318
00:14:12,150 --> 00:14:13,300
When I need you,

319
00:14:13,750 --> 00:14:14,820
you will answer my summons

320
00:14:15,390 --> 00:14:16,490
and come to my aid.

321
00:14:20,030 --> 00:14:20,460
All right.

322
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:26,850
If you hadn't happened

323
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,940
to awaken outside the shrine,

324
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:31,250
you'd never have forgotten who you are,

325
00:14:32,150 --> 00:14:33,580
and I never would've been able

326
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,380
to use your power to fulfill my life's goal,

327
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,320
Saintess of the Tides.

328
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,610
Die, you vile woman!

329
00:14:48,610 --> 00:14:48,940
Youyou!

330
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,420
Are you crazy? What are you doing?

331
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,840
How dare you ask me that?

332
00:14:51,870 --> 00:14:53,120
You liar!

333
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,850
What a despicable thing to do!

334
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,890
I couldn't stop you from wanting His Lordship dead.

335
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,090
And you can hate evil

336
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,220
all you like.

337
00:14:59,390 --> 00:15:00,580
But how could you trick him

338
00:15:00,870 --> 00:15:02,310
and kill him after winning his trust?

339
00:15:02,670 --> 00:15:03,740
Today, I'll avenge His Lordship

340
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,700
and see justice done!

341
00:15:06,630 --> 00:15:07,180
Oh, no!

342
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:08,890
Stay right there! Listen to me!

343
00:15:09,910 --> 00:15:10,340
I...

344
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,180
I had no choice.

345
00:15:12,750 --> 00:15:13,980
I had to save my master.

346
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,460
What else could I do?

347
00:15:15,790 --> 00:15:17,060
What else could you do?

348
00:15:17,170 --> 00:15:18,580
Did you even look for another way?

349
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:19,460
No excuse could justify

350
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:20,820
your deceiving and killing him!

351
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,270
His Lordship even gave you

352
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:22,970
your soul crystal back!

353
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,480
He trusted you completely.

354
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:25,180
And you?

355
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,380
You repaid him

356
00:15:26,380 --> 00:15:27,410
with heartless betrayal!

357
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,730
Die!

358
00:15:30,870 --> 00:15:32,070
Stop acting crazy and listen to me!

359
00:15:32,250 --> 00:15:33,610
- He was evil! He... - I'll kill you,

360
00:15:33,630 --> 00:15:34,730
you evil wretch!

361
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,100
What are you talking about?

362
00:15:38,750 --> 00:15:39,610
You're just in time.

363
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:40,610
I was saying

364
00:15:40,790 --> 00:15:41,770
she's selfish

365
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:42,820
and wicked.

366
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:43,980
To win the immortal sects' protection,

367
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:44,890
she killed

368
00:15:44,890 --> 00:15:46,250
your Big Brother Qi Fengyin herself!

369
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:48,820
He's dead?

370
00:15:51,270 --> 00:15:52,250
- Duyao! - Duyao!

371
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,580
Duyao,

372
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:58,100
listen to me.

373
00:15:58,870 --> 00:15:59,490
Qi Fengyin

374
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:01,100
was a fearsome devil,

375
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:02,100
a terrible villain.

376
00:16:02,510 --> 00:16:04,300
So many people in the immortal sects wanted him dead.

377
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:05,700
If he were still alive,

378
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,490
how much longer would we have to

379
00:16:07,490 --> 00:16:08,300
keep running and hiding?

380
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,220
Besides,

381
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:12,250
you've only met him a few times.

382
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,650
There's no need to be so upset.

383
00:16:20,550 --> 00:16:21,180
Bah!

384
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:22,980
If you hadn't stabbed him in the back,

385
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:24,220
His Lordship would still be alive!

386
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,580
You're with the immortal sects, all right.

387
00:16:27,270 --> 00:16:28,580
You're a coldhearted hypocrite!

388
00:16:29,270 --> 00:16:30,300
Even Duyao,

389
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,460
who only met His Lordship once,

390
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,820
is heartbroken.

391
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,180
Compared to her,

392
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,540
you're not even human!

393
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,060
Of course I'm not human!

394
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,370
I'm just a medicinal herb.

395
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:40,300
You should

396
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:41,700
leave Mount Zhaowu at once.

397
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:42,820
If anyone finds you,

398
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:43,570
I can't save you.

399
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:45,700
I've had enough!

400
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,010
Today, I'll make you

401
00:16:47,030 --> 00:16:47,940
join His Lordship in death!

402
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,010
Stay right there!

403
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,100
Stop crying!

404
00:16:59,080 --> 00:16:59,650
I can't take this anymore.

405
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,100
Come with me.

406
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,860
Can't they just find me

407
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:39,380
some kitchen helpers who know what they're doing?

408
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:49,770
What are you trying to do?

409
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,090
I'm warning you.

410
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:52,310
I've wised up.

411
00:17:52,310 --> 00:17:52,970
You won't fool me again.

412
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:08,090
Big Brother!

413
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:10,730
Let me see.

414
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:20,940
My Lord!

415
00:18:21,330 --> 00:18:21,940
Big Brother!

416
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:23,980
Big Brother!

417
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:24,820
My Lord!

418
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:25,900
- Big Brother! - My Lord!

419
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,360
Calm down, both of you.

420
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,140
My disguise spell

421
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,330
only affects what people see.

422
00:18:30,550 --> 00:18:31,660
It can't stop them from hearing you.

423
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:32,620
If someone finds us out,

424
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:33,460
we're all done for.

425
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,090
Honored cultivators,

426
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:40,530
what are you looking for here?

427
00:18:41,070 --> 00:18:41,810
We...

428
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:46,290
Well...

429
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:56,090
Our sect leader is unwell

430
00:18:56,270 --> 00:18:57,250
and needs

431
00:18:57,270 --> 00:18:58,250
special medicinal dishes,

432
00:18:58,790 --> 00:19:00,770
but we're not very familiar with Mount Zhaowu,

433
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:01,490
so, madam,

434
00:19:02,550 --> 00:19:04,900
could we borrow one of your helpers?

435
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,140
Come on, hurry.

436
00:19:25,070 --> 00:19:25,760
I knew

437
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:26,840
Yamao could never have

438
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:27,570
killed you, My Lord.

439
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:28,380
Be honest.

440
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:29,750
What really happened?

441
00:19:30,110 --> 00:19:31,410
It was all an act, of course.

442
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:33,330
Had Qi Fengyin not faked his death,

443
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:34,770
I wouldn't have dared to come to Mount Zhaowu,

444
00:19:35,310 --> 00:19:36,490
and I'd have no hope of saving Master.

445
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,290
You two planned it all beforehand?

446
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,810
What did Yamao offer His Lordship

447
00:19:45,350 --> 00:19:47,120
to make him play along with her?

448
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:52,010
How do you plan to make it up to me?

449
00:19:57,270 --> 00:19:58,140
After all you've done,

450
00:19:58,590 --> 00:20:00,860
I'll do anything you ask, Lord Qi.

451
00:20:04,350 --> 00:20:05,770
A poisonous herb like you is no use to me.

452
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,940
Big Brother, if you're staying here,

453
00:20:11,550 --> 00:20:13,180
what do we do if they find out who you are?

454
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:14,490
Right now,

455
00:20:14,510 --> 00:20:15,770
all the sects believe Qi Fengyin is dead.

456
00:20:16,160 --> 00:20:17,140
This is when they're

457
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:18,020
least on guard.

458
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,250
Have you found a way to save your master?

459
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:25,140
In seven days,

460
00:20:25,590 --> 00:20:26,860
once the sects repair the Demon Soul Talisman,

461
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:28,290
I can use it to save my master.

462
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:30,090
That talisman is so powerful

463
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:30,940
because it was

464
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,180
mine to begin with.

465
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:34,010
It was formed from my demonic core.

466
00:20:35,830 --> 00:20:37,290
I'm not exaggerating this time.

467
00:20:37,350 --> 00:20:38,380
I'm telling the truth.

468
00:20:39,030 --> 00:20:39,770
When you're done with it,

469
00:20:39,790 --> 00:20:40,730
remember to give it back to me.

470
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:45,180
All right.

471
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,460
Until the talisman is repaired,

472
00:20:48,270 --> 00:20:49,010
we all

473
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:49,980
need to keep a low profile.

474
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:52,700
None of us can afford to slip up.

475
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:59,010
Why are you looking at me?

476
00:20:59,110 --> 00:21:00,530
You should be worried about her.

477
00:21:00,830 --> 00:21:01,860
She's with Du Zhong.

478
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:03,140
And she clearly

479
00:21:03,140 --> 00:21:04,420
hasn't seen much of the world.

480
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:05,250
She'd be easy to fool.

481
00:21:05,790 --> 00:21:06,770
I won't be fooled.

482
00:21:07,550 --> 00:21:09,010
I'm on your side.

483
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:20,570
What's wrong?

484
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,260
You don't want to go back?

485
00:21:27,750 --> 00:21:29,050
You asked me to fake my death to help you.

486
00:21:30,070 --> 00:21:30,730
But you never said

487
00:21:30,750 --> 00:21:31,900
I'd have to disguise myself like this.

488
00:21:32,750 --> 00:21:33,860
In that miserable kitchen,

489
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,530
Yeniang

490
00:21:35,550 --> 00:21:36,860
keeps making me work.

491
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,940
She even made me chop that foul stuff.

492
00:21:41,070 --> 00:21:42,050
You mean the onions?

493
00:21:42,510 --> 00:21:43,770
Now I stink of them.

494
00:21:45,030 --> 00:21:45,730
Disgusting.

495
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:49,090
No wonder you kept washing your hands.

496
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:50,620
I'm not going back.

497
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:57,480
I got these sweets from some disciples

498
00:21:57,480 --> 00:21:58,250
of Luoliang Immortal Sect.

499
00:21:58,550 --> 00:21:58,960
Have one.

500
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,310
There may not be many,

501
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:05,140
but they're worth a fortune.

502
00:22:06,310 --> 00:22:07,470
You can have them all.

503
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:09,050
Is that enough to make it up to you?

504
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:13,860
No.

505
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:20,530
I know

506
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:21,770
it's been hard for you

507
00:22:22,270 --> 00:22:23,280
to stay at Mount Zhaowu

508
00:22:23,350 --> 00:22:24,420
and play along with me.

509
00:22:25,350 --> 00:22:26,250
Since you arrived here,

510
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:27,530
has the Wanjun Lock been affecting you?

511
00:22:33,510 --> 00:22:34,660
This place is rich in spiritual power,

512
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,860
making it much easier for the lock to suppress me.

513
00:22:37,310 --> 00:22:38,010
If this keeps up,

514
00:22:38,030 --> 00:22:38,530
the lock

515
00:22:38,550 --> 00:22:39,530
will soon overpower you.

516
00:22:40,350 --> 00:22:41,630
Why don't you wait for me down the mountain?

517
00:22:42,160 --> 00:22:43,770
The immortal sects are at peace now.

518
00:22:44,030 --> 00:22:44,820
I'll be fine.

519
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:45,770
But if anyone

520
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,450
finds out who you are,

521
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,860
you'll be in serious trouble.

522
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:51,140
I doubt it's as peaceful here as you think.

523
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:53,050
Since I arrived at Mount Zhaowu,

524
00:22:53,830 --> 00:22:55,220
I've sensed a strange aura here.

525
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:56,730
I'd worry if I

526
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:58,660
left you here alone.

527
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:27,700
It hurts so much.

528
00:23:29,510 --> 00:23:30,660
I died a horrible death.

529
00:23:35,960 --> 00:23:37,140
Someone, please save me!

530
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:40,420
Changpu!

531
00:23:44,030 --> 00:23:45,090
Someone, please save me!

532
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:12,180
Changpu?

533
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:22,700
Yeniang?

534
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:29,810
Another nightmare, Master Du?

535
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:36,090
Have a bowl of my Soul-Soothing Porridge.

536
00:24:40,830 --> 00:24:41,250
Here,

537
00:24:41,510 --> 00:24:42,090
Master Du.

538
00:24:59,030 --> 00:25:00,180
Hao, over here!

539
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:07,180
Yamao,

540
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:09,770
what couldn't you tell me during the day

541
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:12,050
that had to be said out here at night?

542
00:25:14,830 --> 00:25:15,570
Sit down first.

543
00:25:26,270 --> 00:25:27,570
I know this seems strange,

544
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:29,660
but it can only be done at night.

545
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:12,220
Is this...?

546
00:26:13,070 --> 00:26:14,620
Moonlit Revival Herbs in full bloom.

547
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:30,320
Master,

548
00:26:31,070 --> 00:26:32,560
I did as you told me

549
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:33,530
and kept it out of the light.

550
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:35,460
Why did this Moonlit Revival Herb

551
00:26:35,460 --> 00:26:36,730
still die?

552
00:26:36,960 --> 00:26:38,140
I've already told you

553
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:40,820
this herb can't be grown by human hands.

554
00:26:41,960 --> 00:26:43,700
Why are you still so obsessed with it?

555
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,050
I'm not obsessed.

556
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:48,420
I just remembered you said

557
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,250
that once fully grown,

558
00:26:50,550 --> 00:26:52,010
this herb could merge with the moonlight

559
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:54,980
and shine wherever it pleased.

560
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:58,090
I was just a little curious to see it.

561
00:26:58,510 --> 00:27:00,530
Only a little. I'm not obsessed.

562
00:27:02,110 --> 00:27:03,330
If you weren't obsessed, you'd be at ease.

563
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:06,290
Why keep repeating that you aren't?

564
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:16,660
Uncle Du once mentioned

565
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,770
in a chat with my master

566
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:19,380
that you took such pains to grow it

567
00:27:20,110 --> 00:27:21,090
because you wanted to see

568
00:27:21,110 --> 00:27:22,410
a Moonlit Revival Herb in full bloom.

569
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:25,490
Thank you, Yamao.

570
00:27:27,510 --> 00:27:28,730
I should be thanking you.

571
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,980
You came down the mountain to save me,

572
00:27:32,310 --> 00:27:34,250
and now you're helping repair the talisman.

573
00:27:35,030 --> 00:27:36,460
You even defied your master's orders

574
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:37,410
and were punished for it.

575
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:40,050
You've done so much for me along the way.

576
00:27:41,550 --> 00:27:42,250
You give me too much credit.

577
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,220
As immortal sect disciples,

578
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,380
of course we should help each other.

579
00:27:47,440 --> 00:27:48,420
As for defying my master's orders,

580
00:27:50,590 --> 00:27:51,660
it wasn't entirely because of you.

581
00:27:54,750 --> 00:27:56,460
But I did benefit from your help.

582
00:27:57,160 --> 00:27:58,490
My master taught me

583
00:27:58,720 --> 00:28:01,540
to repay kindness many times over.

584
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:04,090
But as Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple,

585
00:28:04,090 --> 00:28:04,880
you have everything you need.

586
00:28:05,070 --> 00:28:06,520
I don't have anything of value

587
00:28:06,520 --> 00:28:07,250
to thank you with.

588
00:28:07,640 --> 00:28:09,670
So I thought of this instead.

589
00:28:44,790 --> 00:28:45,620
Consider this display

590
00:28:46,030 --> 00:28:47,800
of silver blossoms my gift.

591
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:49,660
May your path to immortality

592
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:51,050
be as bright as these blossoms

593
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:52,290
and free of all obstacles.

594
00:29:01,790 --> 00:29:02,900
And I wish you

595
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:04,570
peace and good fortune.

596
00:29:05,590 --> 00:29:06,900
I'm sure I'll have both.

597
00:29:07,590 --> 00:29:08,460
In seven days,

598
00:29:08,480 --> 00:29:09,380
once Master is back,

599
00:29:09,790 --> 00:29:11,410
who in the world would dare hurt me?

600
00:29:12,720 --> 00:29:13,380
Then

601
00:29:14,030 --> 00:29:15,600
we'll go to Luoliang Immortal City

602
00:29:15,830 --> 00:29:17,140
and wait for the Wish Tree to appear.

603
00:29:22,750 --> 00:29:23,330
You...

604
00:29:25,790 --> 00:29:28,220
want to marry High Immortal Danshen?

605
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:33,180
Let's hope nothing else goes wrong

606
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,620
and it all turns out just as you wished.

607
00:30:33,400 --> 00:30:34,330
Qi Fengyin?

608
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:38,000
Why did you come over

609
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:38,770
without letting me know?

610
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:39,980
You startled me.

611
00:30:44,270 --> 00:30:44,860
What's wrong?

612
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:46,980
I helped you too.

613
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:49,900
Why did only Yuwen Hao

614
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,050
get to see the Moonlit Revival Herbs?

615
00:30:52,270 --> 00:30:53,290
You were there?

616
00:30:56,350 --> 00:30:57,140
Qi Fengyin,

617
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:59,250
you could be exposed at any moment.

618
00:30:59,680 --> 00:31:00,940
You shouldn't be wandering around.

619
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:01,840
If Yuwen Hao

620
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:02,970
had seen you just now,

621
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:04,180
everything we'd worked for

622
00:31:04,200 --> 00:31:04,850
would've been for nothing.

623
00:31:04,850 --> 00:31:06,140
You didn't answer my question.

624
00:31:07,510 --> 00:31:08,530
Why did I only get

625
00:31:08,550 --> 00:31:10,730
a bag of sweets someone else gave you,

626
00:31:11,070 --> 00:31:12,390
while you went to all this trouble

627
00:31:12,390 --> 00:31:13,700
for Yuwen Hao,

628
00:31:14,350 --> 00:31:15,980
even expending your spiritual power?

629
00:31:17,550 --> 00:31:19,010
You're being ridiculous.

630
00:31:20,070 --> 00:31:21,180
If you don't like

631
00:31:21,200 --> 00:31:21,900
those sweets,

632
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:23,050
you can give them back to me.

633
00:31:23,270 --> 00:31:24,700
Stop twisting my words.

634
00:31:25,030 --> 00:31:25,770
Then what's your point?

635
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,700
You made it clear that you

636
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:34,700
didn't like my true form.

637
00:31:38,070 --> 00:31:39,130
When did I ever say that?

638
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:40,590
At Mount Leiguan.

639
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:43,770
You even said my medicinal scent stank.

640
00:31:45,550 --> 00:31:46,550
That's because you were

641
00:31:46,550 --> 00:31:47,230
being annoying.

642
00:31:47,350 --> 00:31:48,620
I was being annoying?

643
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:54,360
You're just unhappy

644
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:55,230
with life at Mount Zhaowu,

645
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,570
so you're picking a fight with me.

646
00:31:58,160 --> 00:31:58,810
When I was suffering

647
00:31:58,830 --> 00:32:00,180
from your dark energy because of your flower,

648
00:32:00,550 --> 00:32:01,770
did I ever lash out at you?

649
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,420
Why should I have to answer to you

650
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:06,490
just for meeting Yuwen Hao?

651
00:32:07,270 --> 00:32:07,900
Who you see

652
00:32:07,920 --> 00:32:08,860
has nothing to do with me.

653
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:10,810
But as long as you carry the mystical flower,

654
00:32:11,110 --> 00:32:13,250
whether you live or die concerns me.

655
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:16,730
I told you there's something

656
00:32:17,110 --> 00:32:18,490
very strange about Mount Zhaowu.

657
00:32:19,030 --> 00:32:20,250
The one who shouldn't be wandering around

658
00:32:20,350 --> 00:32:20,940
is you.

659
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:23,010
You don't own me.

660
00:32:24,110 --> 00:32:24,980
We're only stuck together

661
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:26,000
because we need each other.

662
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:26,960
What gives you the right

663
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:27,840
to meddle in my affairs?

664
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,460
And if I insist on meddling?

665
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:55,140
Sorry.

666
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,940
I've come at a bad time.

667
00:32:57,110 --> 00:32:58,300
I'll leave you two alone.

668
00:32:58,480 --> 00:32:58,980
No need.

669
00:33:17,750 --> 00:33:18,900
Why did His Lordship leave?

670
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:25,530
Wait, you two were arguing?

671
00:33:27,270 --> 00:33:28,660
Who knows what's gotten into him?

672
00:33:32,480 --> 00:33:33,290
Perfect. I'm hungry.

673
00:33:35,640 --> 00:33:38,220
The cooks at Mount Zhaowu

674
00:33:38,350 --> 00:33:39,290
are terrible!

675
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:40,450
Why are these pastries

676
00:33:40,450 --> 00:33:41,770
so lopsided?

677
00:33:44,350 --> 00:33:45,860
Did Qi Fengyin make these?

678
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:49,380
Did he come to bring me pastries?

679
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:51,810
Was what I said just now

680
00:33:52,310 --> 00:33:53,900
a little too harsh?

681
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:12,420
Of course I don't care who she sees.

682
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:22,090
But she does have a point.

683
00:34:25,110 --> 00:34:26,210
Is it really

684
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:28,690
because I think I own her

685
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:32,420
that I won't let anyone near her

686
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,610
and don't like her getting close to others?

687
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:45,780
Malice?

688
00:35:15,590 --> 00:35:16,440
Master's coming out of seclusion!

689
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:17,690
- Let's go. - Come on.

690
00:35:27,710 --> 00:35:28,820
I never should've gone soft

691
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,300
and eaten Qi Fengyin's pastries.

692
00:35:31,400 --> 00:35:33,090
If I'd known they were this lethal,

693
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:34,170
I'd have used them

694
00:35:34,190 --> 00:35:35,340
to defend myself.

695
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:42,610
Today, the sect leaders

696
00:35:42,610 --> 00:35:43,860
will be repairing the talisman.

697
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:45,860
It's a happy occasion.

698
00:35:46,880 --> 00:35:47,900
I've got to perk up.

699
00:35:58,550 --> 00:35:59,610
Come on. We don't want to be late.

700
00:36:19,670 --> 00:36:21,130
Welcome back

701
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:22,820
from seclusion, Master!

702
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:27,780
I've gathered you all

703
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,340
to make an important announcement.

704
00:36:30,190 --> 00:36:31,860
While healing in seclusion,

705
00:36:32,360 --> 00:36:33,380
I gained insight into the way of Heaven.

706
00:36:34,190 --> 00:36:35,940
I will soon ascend to immortality.

707
00:36:37,220 --> 00:36:37,690
Ascension?

708
00:36:37,710 --> 00:36:38,490
Ascending to immortality?

709
00:36:40,590 --> 00:36:41,490
I thought

710
00:36:41,800 --> 00:36:42,420
ascension

711
00:36:42,760 --> 00:36:44,420
could only happen in ancient legends.

712
00:36:44,800 --> 00:36:45,610
I never imagined

713
00:36:45,710 --> 00:36:46,570
I'd see it with my own eyes.

714
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:47,570
Throughout history,

715
00:36:47,760 --> 00:36:49,570
countless people have sought immortality.

716
00:36:50,030 --> 00:36:51,210
But only the Saintess of the Tides

717
00:36:51,630 --> 00:36:52,820
has ever ascended to godhood.

718
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:55,650
Master has now glimpsed the way of Heaven

719
00:36:56,070 --> 00:36:57,380
and done what no ordinary person could.

720
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:58,820
Mount Zhaowu truly is

721
00:36:59,190 --> 00:37:00,340
the foremost among the immortal sects.

722
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,790
- That's right. - Yes.

723
00:37:03,000 --> 00:37:04,120
- The leading sect! - The leading sect!

724
00:37:07,590 --> 00:37:08,420
Now that I've attained enlightenment,

725
00:37:08,670 --> 00:37:09,570
once I ascend,

726
00:37:10,070 --> 00:37:11,210
I'll choose a place

727
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,170
to live in seclusion.

728
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:14,650
Now that the Devil Incarnate has been slain,

729
00:37:15,190 --> 00:37:16,820
I have no interest in worldly affairs.

730
00:37:18,030 --> 00:37:20,210
Nor am I suited to any position

731
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:21,570
among the immortal sects.

732
00:37:24,550 --> 00:37:25,380
As of today,

733
00:37:26,480 --> 00:37:29,460
the leadership of Mount Zhaowu will pass

734
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:30,940
to my chief disciple,

735
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:32,300
Yuwen Hao.

736
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:35,780
He deserves it!

737
00:37:46,320 --> 00:37:46,780
Master,

738
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:48,740
ascending to godhood

739
00:37:49,360 --> 00:37:50,380
won't change the path you follow.

740
00:37:50,920 --> 00:37:52,380
Why are you leaving Mount Zhaowu?

741
00:37:53,110 --> 00:37:53,900
With my limited cultivation,

742
00:37:54,710 --> 00:37:55,530
I fear I'm not ready yet.

743
00:37:56,360 --> 00:37:57,420
Please reconsider, Master.

744
00:37:59,230 --> 00:37:59,980
That's right, Master.

745
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,210
Hao

746
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:02,690
may be Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple

747
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:03,650
and, by rights,

748
00:38:03,840 --> 00:38:05,460
the natural choice to succeed you.

749
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:07,050
But he has repeatedly

750
00:38:07,550 --> 00:38:09,130
defied your orders and betrayed the sect.

751
00:38:09,670 --> 00:38:10,780
Even after being sent to Wuchang Prison,

752
00:38:11,070 --> 00:38:12,740
he showed no remorse for what he'd done.

753
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:14,570
So I agree

754
00:38:15,110 --> 00:38:17,260
that he's unfit to be sect leader.

755
00:38:20,060 --> 00:38:21,170
Who else is there but Hao?

756
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:23,380
What do you mean, Zhiwei?

757
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,050
Hao is far stronger

758
00:38:25,110 --> 00:38:26,650
than any other disciple in this sect.

759
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:28,740
What happened before was all a misunderstanding.

760
00:38:29,710 --> 00:38:30,980
Now that the Devil Incarnate is dead,

761
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,780
why bring up the past?

762
00:38:33,400 --> 00:38:34,980
If Hao isn't up to the task,

763
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:37,490
do you think you are?

764
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,820
Is that how you speak to your senior?

765
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:39,490
And is that how

766
00:38:39,510 --> 00:38:40,570
you speak to Senior Brother Yuwen?

767
00:38:42,550 --> 00:38:43,130
Enough.

768
00:38:46,150 --> 00:38:47,610
I'm still here.

769
00:38:48,110 --> 00:38:49,980
Is this how you should behave?

770
00:38:51,070 --> 00:38:51,940
We were wrong, Master.

771
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:53,460
Since

772
00:38:54,360 --> 00:38:55,530
there are still doubts

773
00:38:55,670 --> 00:38:57,170
about my successor as sect leader,

774
00:38:57,710 --> 00:38:59,090
I'll follow our sect's rules

775
00:38:59,590 --> 00:39:01,740
and set a succession trial.

776
00:39:02,670 --> 00:39:03,650
Whoever wins

777
00:39:04,760 --> 00:39:05,980
will be the one to succeed me

778
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:06,690
as sect leader.

779
00:39:07,710 --> 00:39:09,010
I wish to take part, Master.

780
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,090
I'm willing to try, Master.

781
00:39:29,360 --> 00:39:30,380
This is a Bodhi Fruit.

782
00:39:30,840 --> 00:39:31,460
Yuwen Hao,

783
00:39:31,630 --> 00:39:32,050
Zhiwei,

784
00:39:32,630 --> 00:39:34,050
you will each take a fruit and nurture it

785
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:35,420
with your cultivation techniques.

786
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:36,530
Whichever of you

787
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:38,490
makes it sprout first

788
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:41,010
will be the next sect leader.

789
00:39:42,670 --> 00:39:43,090
But Master,

790
00:39:44,190 --> 00:39:45,090
it's hollow.

791
00:39:45,510 --> 00:39:46,380
How can I make it sprout?

792
00:39:47,000 --> 00:39:48,090
"Enlightenment is no tree,

793
00:39:48,400 --> 00:39:49,530
nor is the mind a mirror on a stand."

794
00:39:50,150 --> 00:39:51,010
All things in this world

795
00:39:51,280 --> 00:39:52,690
are nothing but emptiness.

796
00:39:53,590 --> 00:39:55,380
If you keep your mind clear and free of obsession

797
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:57,220
and let all things pass through it

798
00:39:57,220 --> 00:39:58,090
without leaving a trace,

799
00:39:58,800 --> 00:40:00,010
that shows true faith in the immortal path.

800
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:01,780
With the path in your heart,

801
00:40:02,190 --> 00:40:04,090
why should a Hollow Bodhi Fruit trouble you?

802
00:40:09,110 --> 00:40:10,570
I never thought someone in the immortal sects

803
00:40:11,440 --> 00:40:13,090
could actually ascend.

804
00:40:14,110 --> 00:40:14,980
Good thing this happened

805
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:16,460
after our time in Peach Blossom Paradise.

806
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:30,490
What were you doing there?

807
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:31,570
None of your business.

808
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:32,340
You...

809
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:34,010
You're still angry?

810
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:38,820
I'll chalk last night up

811
00:40:38,840 --> 00:40:40,050
to you needing to blow off some steam.

812
00:40:40,510 --> 00:40:41,380
I'll be the bigger person

813
00:40:41,380 --> 00:40:42,300
and let it slide.

814
00:40:43,150 --> 00:40:44,350
I even ate your pastries

815
00:40:44,350 --> 00:40:45,420
and had a stomachache all night.

816
00:40:47,400 --> 00:40:48,740
Let's call it even.

817
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,380
Why would those pastries

818
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:51,380
give you a stomachache?

819
00:40:51,550 --> 00:40:52,530
Don't get me started.

820
00:40:54,960 --> 00:40:56,050
Why did you come to the main hall?

821
00:40:59,070 --> 00:41:00,130
I saw a wisp of malice.

822
00:41:00,550 --> 00:41:01,010
What?

823
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:04,900
This is Mount Zhaowu.

824
00:41:05,110 --> 00:41:06,010
The whole mountain is full

825
00:41:06,070 --> 00:41:07,570
of disciples who ward off evil.

826
00:41:07,670 --> 00:41:08,780
How could there be any malice here?

827
00:41:12,110 --> 00:41:14,380
Is the spiritual power here so strong

828
00:41:15,150 --> 00:41:16,490
that it's throwing off your senses?

829
00:41:17,510 --> 00:41:18,170
Believe it or don't.

830
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:19,330
All right.

831
00:41:19,360 --> 00:41:19,980
I believe you.

832
00:41:20,070 --> 00:41:21,300
I believe you, all right?

833
00:41:21,960 --> 00:41:23,530
I saw a wisp of malice last night.

834
00:41:24,510 --> 00:41:26,380
But the spiritual power here is so strong

835
00:41:26,920 --> 00:41:27,900
that I lost its trail.

836
00:41:28,110 --> 00:41:28,820
The Five Great Sects

837
00:41:29,150 --> 00:41:30,340
are all gathered at Mount Zhaowu.

838
00:41:31,150 --> 00:41:32,130
It is possible

839
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:33,090
some people with ill intent

840
00:41:33,590 --> 00:41:34,650
have slipped in among them.

841
00:41:34,960 --> 00:41:36,460
No wonder you kept saying there was something

842
00:41:36,880 --> 00:41:38,130
very strange about Mount Zhaowu.

843
00:41:39,630 --> 00:41:40,300
Don't worry.

844
00:41:40,710 --> 00:41:41,280
I'll help you

845
00:41:41,280 --> 00:41:42,460
find that wisp of malice.

846
00:41:43,030 --> 00:41:43,650
But this disguise spell

847
00:41:44,590 --> 00:41:45,780
I cast with medicinal powder

848
00:41:46,190 --> 00:41:47,530
is only a simple trick.

849
00:41:48,190 --> 00:41:49,460
If anyone gets suspicious,

850
00:41:49,630 --> 00:41:50,940
they can easily break it.

851
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,090
Remember,

852
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:53,610
don't go parading around

853
00:41:53,630 --> 00:41:54,300
where the disciples

854
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:55,530
can see you.

855
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:58,010
I'm still stronger than the Wanjun Lock.

856
00:41:58,760 --> 00:42:00,210
Unless I choose to reveal myself,

857
00:42:00,630 --> 00:42:02,050
no one can find me.

858
